---
/** Team hero: eyebrow, the page's single h1 and the standing-brief paragraph. */
---
<section class="hero container" aria-labelledby="team-title">
  <p class="eyebrow mono"><span class="sq" aria-hidden="true"></span>the team · ten standing briefs</p>
  <div class="grid">
    <h1 id="team-title">Every role has a brief, a budget and a gate.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      An agent is not a chatbot with a job title. Each one holds a written brief, a set of inputs it is
      allowed to read, outputs it is expected to produce, and a hard stop where a human or another agent
      has to sign.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero { position: relative; z-index: 1; padding-block: 56px 34px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink); }
  .eyebrow {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
    font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: var(--mag); margin-bottom: 22px;
  }
  .sq { width: 7px; height: 7px; background: var(--mag); flex: none; }

  .grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(0, 0.8fr);
    gap: 56px; align-items: end;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(44px, 6.5vw, 76px); font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 0.92; letter-spacing: -0.05em; max-width: 17ch;
  }
  .lede { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--body); margin: 0 0 6px; }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 24px; align-items: start; }
    .lede { margin-bottom: 0; }
  }
</style>
